                            	  3106:     ;
02:000304FE 610017C6        	  3107:     jsr     CheckLinkCollision
                            	  3108:     ; If moving horizontally, then set target coordinate in [00] to $78
                            	  3109:     ; and current coordinate to the trap's X.
