                            	  3608:     ; There are actually 6 frame images divided into 2 sets.
                            	  3609:     ; Each set depicts one animation frame. In each set there are
                            	  3610:     ; 3 frame images: 1 for each direction (left, up, down).
                            	  3611:     ;
                            	  3612:     ; The movement frame will keep track of the base offset of
                            	  3613:     ; the current set for the current animation frame: 0 or 3.
                            	  3614:     ;
                            	  3615:     ; So, XOR the movement frame with 3.
                            	  3616:     ;
