                            	  6222: _L_z04_CheckBigDigdoggerCollisions_LoopCornerCollision:
                            	  6223:     ; Digdogger is big, but room boundary checks and
                            	  6224:     ; object collision checks assume a 16x16 monster or smaller.
                            	  6225:     ; Therefore, we have to check these things four times,
                            	  6226:     ; in different corners of the boss.
