                            	 11270:     ; The animation timer has expired. There are two choices for arming it.
                            	 11271:     ;
                            	 11272:     ; When writhing after a hit, Gleeok animates faster.
                            	 11273:     ; So, when the writhing counter <> 0, set a shorter time (6).
                            	 11274:     ; Otherwise, set a longer time ($10).
                            	 11275:     ;
