                            	   194: UpdateMenuUW_JumpTable:
02:0003FFC2 00040048        	   195:     dc.l    UpdateMenu_Return   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
02:0003FFC6 00040014        	   196:     dc.l    UpdateMenuCommon1   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
02:0003FFCA 0004004A        	   197:     dc.l    UpdateMenuCommon2   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
