02:0003FFF4 00040014        	   213:     dc.l    UpdateMenuCommon1   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
02:0003FFF8 0004004A        	   214:     dc.l    UpdateMenuCommon2   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
