                            	  6042: _L_z05_UpdateDoors_LoopTransferRec:
                            	  6043:     ; Copy [06] to [04] for the call to write tiles below.
                            	  6044:     ; We need to remember how many tiles need to be copied
                            	  6045:     ; in each transfer record.
